      </li>
      <li>
      Configure the image registry to use the CephFS file system storage by entering the following command:
      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc patch config.image/cluster -p '{\"spec\":{\"managementState\":\"Managed\",\"replicas\":2,\"storage\":{\"managementState\":\"Unmanaged\",\"pvc\":{\"claim\":\"registry-storage-pvc\"}}}}' --type=merge"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
